{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-11-01 10:04:00', 'title': 'NIPSCO ADVANCES ITS COST-SAVING ELECTRIC GENERATION TRANSITION PLAN WITH GROUNDBREAKING OF FIRST TWO SOLAR PROJECTS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORTHERN INDIANA PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY LLC (NIPSCO), A SUBSIDIARY OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS FIRST TWO INDIANA-BASED SOLAR PROJECTS – INDIANA CROSSROADS SOLAR AND DUNNS BRIDGE SOLAR I – HAVE BROKEN GROUND AND ARE CURRENTLY UNDER CONSTRUCTION, EXPECTED TO BE ONLINE AND OPERATING IN 2022.'}